Probably not in full. Under the current terms (version terms-2026-04), a vehicle booking must be cancelled at least 48 hours before departure for a full refund. Cancelling less than 48 hours before departure gets you 50% back.

So if you cancel the day before sailing, you would normally receive a 50% refund. To get the full refund, you would need to cancel at least 48 hours before departure. Changing the sailing instead of cancelling is free up to 24 hours before departure.
